{"title":"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 24","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/e/52e8ed7a3ba22130ad3984eb2cd413406475a689.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is a constant such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/8/958fcbb0cff7fde42d3f720e6c7a236e6a5fa515.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 &lt; \\theta &lt; \\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"77\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/0/f006790bad98199bc1b279edc7b5b11e1a31dca4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + \\dfrac{1}{x} = 2\\cos{\\theta}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"119\" height=\"37\" />, then for each positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/6/c8654d2f25ad0cbc280f093cb22278664312a8a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^n + \\dfrac{1}{x^n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"63\" height=\"37\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/9/89916a16f05b35939fc5ad52e83be17c558294b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 2\\cos\\theta\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 2^n\\cos\\theta\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 2\\cos^n\\theta\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 2\\cos n\\theta\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 2^n\\cos^n\\theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"593\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Multiply both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and rearrange to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/f/b8ff9b0e818cae17726b75105248e34306ca3f0f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-2x\\cos(\\theta)+1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"174\" height=\"19\" />. Using the quadratic equation, we can solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. After some simplifying:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/f/4dfaa96d4f48bb666eb8c48146e1492987ef6c2f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x=\\cos(\\theta) + \\sqrt{\\cos^2(\\theta)-1}\\]\" width=\"208\" height=\"32\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/c/69c6dddc307c908580702605d7feffffbf3cbc9c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x=\\cos(\\theta) + \\sqrt{(-1)(\\sin^2(\\theta))}\\]\" width=\"226\" height=\"32\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/5/e952a9c3624de3f2c1b1dab34054d82ca63ee950.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x=\\cos(\\theta) + i\\sin(\\theta)\\]\" width=\"157\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Substituting this expression in to the desired <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/6/c8654d2f25ad0cbc280f093cb22278664312a8a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^n + \\dfrac{1}{x^n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"63\" height=\"37\" /> gives:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/7/147b08fd15b530e18f6e3c39644bc552a3e5dcf4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(\\cos(\\theta) + i\\sin(\\theta))^n + (\\cos(\\theta) + i\\sin(\\theta))^{-n}\\]\" width=\"325\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Using DeMoivre's Theorem:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/a/10a4879a58d6eb32e0da94dfaf3552f7f04b2d80.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[=\\cos(n\\theta) + i\\sin(n\\theta) + \\cos(-n\\theta) + i\\sin(-n\\theta)\\]\" width=\"360\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/5/bb5e108fdc4bf4fb6151cb922992f23bc6c35985.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos$\" width=\"24\" height=\"8\" /> is even and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/b/6fb300dacfcde1b57ad070409262b1743e0cd966.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"24\" height=\"14\" /> is odd:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/4/9c4ab1d8bcdb50a156082686378683e6c4732c1c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[=\\cos(n\\theta) + i\\sin(n\\theta) + \\cos(n\\theta) - i\\sin(n\\theta)\\]\" width=\"331\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/b/50bdee4e39e193a9e8010c2118f0531fea2deb50.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[=\\boxed{2\\cos(n\\theta)},\\]\" width=\"104\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>which gives the answer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/5/8350aedfc4551512dd310605eac2752dc9cac449.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{D}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"29\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Because we have \\(x + \\frac{1}{x} = 2\\cos \\theta\\), squaring both sides gives  \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/c/71c663c999b77591c3ed5f32e0cb25941ff28e5e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2 + 2 + \\frac{1}{x^2} = 4\\cos^2 \\theta.\\]\" width=\"176\" height=\"37\" />  \nSubtracting 2 from both sides, we get  \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/8/b38127178dfb8d33e83bf9a7255f6667b2a46e52.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2 + \\frac{1}{x^2} = 4\\cos^2 \\theta - 2.\\]\" width=\"176\" height=\"37\" />  \nRewriting,  \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/c/a0ccf908c4c84792cc9ac284fe1f5be15721855c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2 - \\frac{1}{x^2} = 2(2\\cos^2 \\theta - 1) = 2\\cos(2\\theta).\\]\" width=\"292\" height=\"37\" />  \nNow, looking at the answer choices, the only one matching this form for \\(n = 2\\) is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/5/8350aedfc4551512dd310605eac2752dc9cac449.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{D}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"29\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p>~Voidling\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME\" title=\"1981 AHSME\">1981 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1981 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1981\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017031215\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [